<title>USA: Basic Earth sees FY 1997 shr under $0.01.</title>
<headline>Basic Earth sees FY 1997 shr under $0.01.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basic Earth Science Systems Inc said Wednesday that it expects to report net income of about $110,000, less than one cent per share, on oil and gas revenue of about $3 million for the fiscal year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The company reported net income of $6,000, on revenue of $2,826,000 in fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>The company cited increased average commodity oil and gas prices for this increase in net income and gross revenue.</p>
</text>
